# Why EXPM1, LOG1P, ERF and a hypot-based |z| are refused: the MSL standard library
# of this OS does not define them. Header directory:
/System/Library/PrivateFrameworks/GPUCompiler.framework/Versions/32023/Libraries/lib/clang/32023.886/include/metal

$ grep -n 'METAL_FUNC float \(expm1\|log1p\|erf\|hypot\)(' metal_math
(no match)

$ grep -c 'expm1\|log1p\|erf\|hypot' metal_math
0

# What it does define, for the tags this slice serves:
exp      3
log      3
sin      3
cos      3
tanh     3
sqrt     3
rsqrt    3
pow      3
fmod     3
fabs     3
divide   3
